Package: tofi
Version: @DEB_TOFI_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/philj56/tofi
Depends: libwayland0, libxkbcommon0, libcairo2, libpango-1.0-0, libglib2.0-0, libharfbuzz0b, libfreetype6
Description: Tiny dynamic menu for Wayland
 tofi is a fast dmenu/rofi-style launcher for Wayland compositors. It draws
 with cairo and pango/harfbuzz into wl_shm buffers and maps as a layer-shell
 client under the iosc compositor.
